WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.500
When you're nearby, Clear Day gives you a morning and evening greeting, with a helpful update on your day.

2
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.070
Messages from family and friends appear on screen, with a simple tap to respond.

3
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.420
Medication reminders appear on the screen.

4
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.480
Upcoming plans stay visible, with a countdown to important dates.

5
00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.920
Tap the microphone to ask a question or add an event.

6
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.140
And mark appointments as complete when they’re done.

7
00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:43.160
Simple daily support, designed to help people stay confident and independent at home.
